eger denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229794,"global_rank":112929},{"name":"jessica1438/Conflict_Alert_RAG","owner":"jessica1438","html_url":"https://github.com/jessica1438/Conflict_Alert_RAG","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"This Streamlit app uploads CSVs, extracts facts, detects conflicts with regex + NLP, and answers queries using a RAG system with LangChain + GPT-4. It\u2019s Dockerized, deployed via AWS ECR. Working on deploying this in ECS Fargate, and automate with GitHub Actions for production.","topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":112939},{"name":"pbuggaveeti28/python-docker","owner":"pbuggaveeti28","html_url":"https://github.com/pbuggaveeti28/python-docker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":112943}]